---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Tiny Video Tools — how your data is handled when using Video Translator for Mac.">
  <Nav slot="nav" />

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: May 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sm">
    <div class="container prose-layout">
      <div class="prose">

        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Tiny Video Tools is a personal tools site maintained by an independent developer.
          I take privacy seriously. This page explains what data is collected (or not collected)
          when you use Video Translator for Mac and visit this website.
        </p>

        <h2>Video files</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Your video files are not uploaded to any server by default.</strong>
          Video Translator for Mac processes files locally on your Mac.
          Unless you explicitly opt in to a cloud AI feature, no video or audio data
          leaves your device.
        </p>
        <p>
          When a cloud AI feature is used (for example, to improve transcription accuracy),
          only the audio portion of the video may be sent to a third-party API service.
          This will always be clearly indicated in the app before any upload occurs.
        </p>

        <h2>Data collection on this website</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to collect
          basic, anonymous traffic statistics (page views, browser type, country).
          This analytics tool does not use cookies, does not fingerprint users,
          and does not track individuals across sites.
        </p>
        <p>
          No other tracking scripts, advertising pixels, or third-party analytics
          are used on this site.
        </p>

        <h2>Email and feedback</h2>
        <p>
          If you contact me by email or submit a feedback form, I will use your message
          to improve the tools. Your email address will only be used to reply to you
          and will never be shared or sold to third parties.
        </p>

        <h2>User accounts</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not have user accounts, login, or any kind of registration.
          No personal accounts are created or stored.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not use first-party cookies for tracking or advertising.
          Cloudflare may set technical cookies required for site delivery and security.
        </p>

        <h2>Model training</h2>
        <p>
          Your video files, audio, and subtitle data are <strong>never used to train
          AI models</strong> — by me or by any third-party service.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>
          These tools are not directed at children under 13. I do not knowingly
          collect personal data from children.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this privacy policy, or wish to request deletion
          of any data, please email:
          <a href="mailto:hello@lingyuetools.com">hello@lingyuetools.com</a>
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero { padding: 4rem 0 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .page-hero h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .page-subtitle { font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }

  .prose-layout { max-width: 680px; }
</style>
